1. Project Overview

LearnPilot AI is an AI-powered education assistant designed to help students with explanations, personalized lessons, quizzes, progress tracking, and educational reporting.

The project uses a FastAPI backend to receive student requests and an agent orchestration workflow to route requests to specialized educational agents.

Main capabilities
Doubt resolution and educational explanations.
Personalized lesson generation.
Quiz generation.
Student progress tracking.
Parent reporting.
Curriculum retrieval using a local ChromaDB vector database.
Student profile and learning-progress persistence.
MCP integration for invoking the tutor through an MCP-compatible client.
A JavaScript frontend communicating with the backend API.
Main request flow
A student submits a request through the frontend or API.
FastAPI receives the request.
The application loads the student's profile and mastery information.
LangGraph orchestrates the request.
The selected specialist agent processes the task.
The curriculum retrieval system supplies relevant context when appropriate.
The response is returned as structured JSON.
Student interaction and progress data can be stored in the local database.
