python -X utf8 .\test_mcp.py


Do not globally redirect stdout when using MCP stdio transport.

Problem F: Gemini quota exhausted

Inspect the actual Google API error and check the applicable model and project limits.

Do not assume that changing the model name alone resolves the quota issue. Check which quota is exhausted and whether the alternative model has available quota.

